```

The vertical component of tension is $$T\cos\phi$$. Applying Newton's second law vertically,

$$
T\cos\phi-mg=ma.
$$

Solving for the full tension gives

$$
T=\frac{m(g+a)}{\cos\phi}.
$$

So the answer is $$\boxed{\text{B}}$$.
